            </note>
            <note corresp="#d659-f2" n="49" xml:id="d659-f2-content">
                <p>The Department approved this instruction to Shanghai in telegram No. 353, October
                    26, 5 p.m.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d659-f3" n="50" xml:id="d659-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d659-f4" n="51" xml:id="d659-f4-content">
                <p>Sir Miles W. Lampson, British Minister in China.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d659-f5" n="52" xml:id="d659-f5-content">
                <p>Akira Ariyoshi, Japanese Minister in China.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
